abstract: "Rockets drawn from sourced sizes: line drawings and painted 3D views of each variant, together, apart and each part alone, rockets at one scale beside a person and a building, and journeys to other worlds, as a web component, an SVG string and a typed model. Every size names its source; every model and picture is credited in NOTICE.md."
